[{"sha":"426fa8cdab4247e5623e9617d531f6917482b947","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKDQyNmZhOGNkYWI0MjQ3ZTU2MjNlOTYxN2Q1MzFmNjkxNzQ4MmI5NDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"zm-oai","email":"zm@openai.com","date":"2026-08-27T23:47:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"copyberry","email":"copyberry@app.openai.com","date":"2026-08-27T23:58:09Z"},"message":"Use compatible PowerShell for elevated Windows sandbox commands (#41227)\n\n## Why\n\nMicrosoft Store PowerShell executables under `WindowsApps` can be inaccessible to the dedicated elevated sandbox account.\n\n## What changed\n\n- For local elevated sandbox commands that target Store PowerShell, select the first compatible `pwsh.exe` or `powershell.exe` from `PATH` or the standard fallback locations.\n- Continue adding `-NoProfile`, and preserve the selected shell for remote execution and other sandbox modes.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded unit coverage for Store-path filtering, fallback ordering, local replacement, and remote-path preservation.\n\nGitOrigin-RevId: 8ab3d0db925e886879701445040f13902fb1ad24","tree":{"sha":"721d278cdd8dea3785f80a35983870093200607c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/721d278cdd8dea3785f80a35983870093200607c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/426fa8cdab4247e5623e9617d531f6917482b947","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/426fa8cdab4247e5623e9617d531f6917482b947","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/426fa8cdab4247e5623e9617d531f6917482b947","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/426fa8cdab4247e5623e9617d531f6917482b947/comments","author":{"login":"zm-oai","id":215741035,"node_id":"U_kgDODNvyaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215741035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zm-oai","html_url":"https://github.com/zm-oai","followers_url":"https://ap